Benefits Management

Ensure that the business benefits associated with your cloud investments are realized and sustained.

---

The success of your transformation is determined by the resulting <span style="color: purple;">business benefits</span>.

Clear identification of the desired benefits upfront will allow you to prioritize your cloud investments and track transformation progress over time.

Identify metrics, <span style="color: purple;">quantify desired benefits</span>, and communicate to the relevant stakeholders.

Align the timing and lifespan of benefits with your strategic goals.

Incorporate benefits delivery into a benefits realization roadmap.

Regularly measure realized benefits, evaluate progress against the benefits realization roadmap, and adjust the expected benefits as required.